  "description_text": "A secret garden in West Seattle. Professionally landscaped gardens and lush greenery surround this well-maintained, freshly painted 1-bedroom, 1-bath Craftsman, creating a private setting for the spacious front deck. Inside, hardwood floors complement the remodeled kitchen with stainless steel appliances, and a restored clawfoot tub adds vintage character to the updated bath. A separate utility room includes a washer and dryer. The earlier remodel included updates to wiring, plumbing, windows, and the sewer line. Close to Alaska Junction shops and restaurants, Trader Joe's, and Fairmount Playground, with convenient access to downtown Seattle.",
