  "description_text": "Meet Greenwood Park Trio, where sunlight steals the show and the little details deserve an encore! This detached, new-construction home shines with a sprawling, custom floor plan offering high ceilings and a wall of windows that lets the day pour in. A chef's kitchen with a generous island seating four, makes room for morning coffee & culinary adventures. Open, airy living spaces invite you to settle in, spread out, and stay awhile, with a convenient powder room on the main. All three bedrooms are positioned upstairs. Top floor primary has dual closets and in the primary bath, cozy radiant floor heat greets your toes, and an artfully crafted, envelope-cut shower floor adds a distinctive finishing touch. There's no carpeting anywhere-just a fresh, cohesive feel throughout. Head to the rooftop deck for lovely territorial views and a little daydreaming, or enjoy the south-facing patio with oversized stamped-concrete pavers. Easy parking with an EV charger and an included full-size washer and dryer keep the practical side of life beautifully in step. Last but not least no HOA dues!!",
